WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.150 --> 00:00:22.490
Mkati mwa chiberekero, mwana wosabadwa amazunguliridwa ndi mawu odekha komanso odekha, kuphatikizapo awo

2
00:00:22.490 --> 00:00:31.870
kugunda kwa mtima wa mayi ndi dongosolo la m'mimba ndi mawu ndi mawu ochokera kudziko lakunja. Monga

3
00:00:31.870 --> 00:00:38.750
mimba ikafika pomaliza, maso a mwanayo amatha kutseguka mkati mwa chiberekero. Pamene iwo sangakhoze

4
00:00:38.750 --> 00:00:46.950
komabe amawona zithunzi kapena zambiri, amatha kuzindikira kusintha kwa kuwala. Choncho, pamene moyo m'mimba ndi wosamveka

5
00:00:46.950 --> 00:00:56.840
ndipo mdima, uli kutali ndi chete. Kubadwa ndi kusintha kwakukulu kwa mwana. Amalowa mwadzidzidzi

6
00:00:56.840 --> 00:01:03.820
dziko lodzaza ndi zatsopano, zowoneka bwino komanso zomveka. Kuzoloŵera ku dziko latsopanoli n’komveka

7
00:01:03.820 --> 00:01:10.340
kudzuka komwe kumakankha-kuyambitsa kukula kwawo. M’milungu ingapo yoyambirira ya moyo, mwanayo amatero

8
00:01:10.340 --> 00:01:17.200
kudzidzimuka ndi kudzuka ngati pali phokoso lalikulu. Maso awo amakhudzidwa ndi kuwala kowala,

9
00:01:17.200 --> 00:01:25.330
koma amaonabe zochepa kwambiri. Masomphenya awo, komabe, akuyamba kukula modabwitsa

10
00:01:25.330 --> 00:01:33.240
mlingo. M'milungu iwiri yokha, kuona bwino kwambiri. Tsopano atha kuwona zambiri, makamaka

11
00:01:33.240 --> 00:01:39.780
ngati zinthu zili pafupi. Palibe mtundu, ndipo zomwe amawona zimakhala zafulati chifukwa cha maso awo

12
00:01:39.780 --> 00:01:45.880
sali olunjika nthawi zonse ndipo amagwira ntchito limodzi kuti azindikire mwakuya. Nthawi zina maso awo

13
00:01:45.880 --> 00:01:52.730
adzalowerera mkati kapena kunja kwa kanthawi kochepa. Izi zimatchedwa squinting. Izi zileke kuchitika

14
00:01:52.730 --> 00:02:00.340
pa miyezi itatu. Pakatha mwezi umodzi, mawonekedwe amtundu amayamba kukula. Zakhala zambiri

15
00:02:00.340 --> 00:02:06.160
chidwi chowoneka, makamaka kumaso. Adzayambanso kuyesa kutsatira zinthu

16
00:02:06.160 --> 00:02:13.030
zomwe zikuyenda. Adzazindikira kwambiri mawu odziwika bwino, kuphatikizapo odziwika bwino

17
00:02:13.030 --> 00:02:19.450
mawu, monga banja lawo, ndikuyamba kulumikiza zomwe amva ndi zomwe akumva

18
00:02:19.450 --> 00:02:24.820
onani. Pofika miyezi itatu, maso awo ayenera kukhala owongoka ndikugwira ntchito limodzi kuti alenge

19
00:02:24.820 --> 00:02:31.620
Mawonedwe a 3D. Lingaliro lakuya latsopanoli limawathandiza kufikira zinthu molondola. Iwo

20
00:02:31.620 --> 00:02:37.240
azitha kutsatira zinthu zomwe zikuyenda mwachangu. Panthawi imodzimodziyo, phokoso latanthauzo

21
00:02:37.240 --> 00:02:45.420
zidzayamba kupangidwa. Pakatha miyezi isanu ndi umodzi, mwanayo ayenera kuzindikira anthu omwe amawadziwa bwino

22
00:02:45.420 --> 00:02:50.960
ndi nkhope zawo ndi mawu. Akhozanso kuyamba kuona zinthu zopitirira

23
00:02:50.960 --> 00:02:57.880
kutali. Motsogozedwa ndi chidwi, amafikira zinthu, kukwawira kwa iwo, ndi kuzungulira

24
00:02:57.880 --> 00:03:03.760
kubadwa kwawo koyamba, kuyenda. Kubwebweta kwawo kukukula ndipo kumveka kumakhala koyamba

25
00:03:03.760 --> 00:03:13.460
mawu pa nthawi ino komanso. Pofika miyezi 18, masomphenya amakhala ngati akuluakulu, ngakhale akadali

26
00:03:13.460 --> 00:03:20.520
kusamveka pang'ono. Tsopano azitha kuzindikira dzina lawo ndikugwiritsa ntchito mawu ochulukirapo.

27
00:03:22.070 --> 00:03:28.300
Ana ena sangakwaniritse zochitika zazikuluzikuluzi panthaŵi yomwe akuyembekezeka. Alipo

28
00:03:28.300 --> 00:03:34.210
zifukwa zambiri za izi, ndipo ambiri adzikonza okha. Mwachitsanzo, ana obadwa msanga

29
00:03:34.210 --> 00:03:40.920
Zitha kukhala zochedwetsa, koma nthawi zambiri zimachitika paubwana. Kwa ena, pangakhale kulimbikira

30
00:03:40.920 --> 00:03:47.710
zovuta. Kuzindikira izi mwachangu momwe mungathere kuti mupereke chithandizo ndi chithandizo

31
00:03:47.710 --> 00:03:49.210
kukulitsa chitukuko.
